        <RevenueAmt>3446</RevenueAmt>
        <Desc>Grant from Metabolon. Funds were provided to guide synthesis of an unknown natural product including providing spectroscopic services. Funds were used to sponsor lecture costs as well as conduct spectroscopic services.</Desc>
