    <IRS990ScheduleO documentId="R000006" softwareId="22015720" softwareVersionNum="v1.00">
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Header, Line B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>We have amended this return due to a change by the NIH in notice of award revision for NIH grant 1201624945A1. The original award was for 275,000 without indirect costs. After considerable negotiations, the grant awarded the IDC of 12/19/2024. Funds were not obtained during this funding period but in 2/2025 and will be reported correctly in this calendar year. We also were requested to revise our allocations in Part IX by the Department of Health and Human Services.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section B, Line 11b</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>We are a small organization. The application is prepared, reviewed and submitted at least 15 days prior to the deadline. Our annual finances are prepared with itemization and are not currently audited due to our small size. All members of our organization are provided copies and can review it.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section B, Line 12c</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>We are a small organization and have meetings every other week with all projects. At each meeting all individuals and teams that work with our organization are asked if any issues exist. All programs and members of the organization sign that they accept the policies of the Institute. Our policies have been reviewed and accepted by the National Institutes of Health.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section C, Line 19</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Governance, Mangement and Disclosure, Section C Disclosure. Governing documents, conflict of interest policy, and financial status. Our conflict of interest policies are online. Our financial status can be searched and found on multiple websites that list this data on non-profit research institutes. We provided copies of our governing documents upon request.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part IX, Line 24e</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Costs for materials, supplies, reagents, and equipment usage for scientific research</ExplanationTxt>
